Licensing
=========

This repository does not contain the Linux kernel source. It contains
packaging, configuration, scripts, and a third-party scheduler patch.

Do not treat a single license as covering every file.


Packaging, scripts, and documentation
-------------------------------------

SPDX-License-Identifier: 0BSD

The `PKGBUILD` is derived from the official Arch Linux `linux` PKGBUILD,
which Arch publishes under 0BSD. EnigmarsOS scripts, GitHub Actions
workflow, and documentation are also 0BSD so they can be copied back
into Arch-style packaging without a license mismatch.

See `LICENSES/0BSD.txt`.


Linux kernel (downloaded at build time)
---------------------------------------

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only WITH Linux-syscall-note

The kernel tarball comes from kernel.org. Arch's extra patch comes from
https://github.com/archlinux/linux/releases. Neither is stored in this
repository. Redistribute built kernels under the kernel's own license.


BORE scheduler patch
--------------------

File: `patches/bore.patch`
Upstream: https://github.com/firelzrd/bore-scheduler
Author: Masahito Suzuki
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

BORE's upstream `LICENSE.txt` is the GNU GPL version 2. The patch is
included verbatim. See that project for the full license text.


PGP keys
--------

`keys/pgp/` contains public keys used to verify kernel.org and Arch
source signatures. They are public key material, not original works of
this project.


Attribution
-----------

- Linux kernel: Linus Torvalds and contributors
- Arch Linux kernel packaging: Jan Alexander Steffens (heftig) and
  Arch Linux contributors
- BORE: Masahito Suzuki (firelzrd) and contributors
